(A) Each candidate qualifying for the Office of Mayor of the Town of Clermont, Georgia and each candidate qualifying for Council posts of the Town of Clermont, Georgia shall accompany his notice with an affidavit stating:

- (1) His residence, with street and number, if any, and his post office address;

- (2) His profession, business, or occupation, if any; (3) The name of his precinct; (4) That he is an elector of the municipality of his residence and is eligible to vote in the election in which he is a candidate;

